{"sha": "7f54720d531db29f25fb2e3d2631295f6f95d260c0fbbaa5b4de3ff7a3c62632", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:funcseq:8}", "取 $\\varepsilon = 1$，则存在 $N$，使得 $\\norm{P_n - P_m}_{\\infty,", "\\R} \\leq 1$ 对所有 $m, n \\geq N$ 成立。在 $\\R$ 上有界的多项式", "必为常数（非常数者趋于 $\\pm\\infty$）：$P_n - P_m =", "c_{n,m}$ 为常数。于是对 $n \\geq N$，$P_n = P_N + c_n$，其中", "$c_n = P_n(0) - P_N(0)$ 收敛（$0$ 处逐点收敛）。", "因此 $f = \\lim P_n = P_N + \\lim c_n$，是一个多项式。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:funcseq:9}", "(a) $\\norm{(3/4)^n\\varphi(4^n\\cdot)}_\\infty = \\frac12", "(3/4)^n$：正规收敛，故 $W$ 连续", "（见\\cref{thm:b2:funcseq:seriestransfer}）。", "", "(b) 固定 $x$、$m$；选取 $h_m = \\pm\\frac12 4^{-m}$ 的符号，使", "线段 $\\intcc{4^mx}{4^m(x + h_m)}$（长为 $\\frac12$）", "不含半整数，从而 $\\varphi$ 在其上为斜率 $\\pm1$ 的仿射映射", "（这是可以做到的：长为 $\\frac12$ 的区间至多含一个", "半整数点，取避开它的那一侧）。", "", "对 $n > m$，$4^n h_m = \\pm\\frac12 4^{n-m}$ 为整数，且", "$\\varphi$ 以 $1$ 为周期：差中第 $n$ 项", "为零。", "", "对 $n = m$，$\\abs{\\varphi(4^m x + 4^m h_m) - \\varphi(4^m x)} =", "\\abs{4^m h_m} = \\frac12$（$\\varphi$ 在该", "线段上为斜率 $\\pm 1$ 的仿射映射），故该项对差商的贡献恰为 $(3/4)^m \\cdot", "\\frac{1/2}{\\abs{h_m}} = (3/4)^m\\,4^m = 3^m$。", "", "对 $n < m$，$1$-利普希茨的 $\\varphi$ 给出", "$\\bigl|(3/4)^n\\bigl(\\varphi(4^nx + 4^nh_m) -", "\\varphi(4^nx)\\bigr)\\bigr| \\leq (3/4)^n 4^n\\abs{h_m} =", "3^n\\abs{h_m}$：每项对差商的贡献至多为 $3^n$。", "", "于是", "\\[", "\\Bigl|\\frac{W(x + h_m) - W(x)}{h_m}\\Bigr|", "\\geq 3^m - \\sum_{n=0}^{m-1} 3^n", "= 3^m - \\frac{3^m - 1}{2} = \\frac{3^m + 1}{2}", "\\longrightarrow \\infty .", "\\]", "若 $W$ 在 $x$ 处可导，则沿", "$h_m \\to 0$ 的每个差商都应收敛于 $W'(x)$，矛盾。$W$ 是", "处处连续，处处不可导。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:funcseq:10}", "逐点收敛：对 $x \\in \\intco{0}{1}$，该级数是公比", "为 $-x$ 的几何级数，", "\\[", "\\sum_{n\\geq0}(-1)^n x^n(1-x) = \\frac{1-x}{1+x},", "\\]", "而在 $x = 1$ 处每一项均为零，和为 $0 = \\frac{1-1}{2}$，", "与之相符 --- 和函数在 $\\intcc{0}{1}$ 上连续。", "一致性：余项为几何级数的尾项，", "\\[", "\\abs{R_N(x)} = \\frac{x^{N+1}(1-x)}{1+x} \\leq x^{N+1}(1 - x)", "\\leq \\max_{\\intcc01} t^{N+1}(1-t)", "= \\frac{1}{N+2}\\Bigl(\\frac{N+1}{N+2}\\Bigr)^{\\!N+1}", "\\leq \\frac{1}{N+2} \\to 0 ,", "\\]", "对 $x$ 一致成立。不是正规收敛：$\\norm{u_n}_\\infty =", "\\max x^n(1-x) = \\frac{1}{n+1}\\bigl(\\frac{n}{n+1}\\bigr)^n \\sim", "\\frac{1}{\\eu\\,n}$，且 $\\sum \\frac1{\\eu n}$ 发散。对比：", "$\\sum x^n(1-x)$ 的部分和为 $1 - x^{N+1}$，", "逐点收敛于\\emph{不连续}的 $\\mathbf 1_{\\intco01}$：由", "\\cref{thm:b2:funcseq:continuity}，该收敛不可能", "在 $\\intcc{0}{1}$ 上一致。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:funcseq:11}", "极限函数 $f$ 连续（见\\cref{thm:b2:funcseq:continuity}）。", "于是", "\\[", "\\abs{f_n(x_n) - f(x)}", "\\leq \\abs{f_n(x_n) - f(x_n)} + \\abs{f(x_n) - f(x)}", "\\leq \\norm{f_n - f}_\\infty + \\abs{f(x_n) - f(x)} ,", "\\]", "两项都趋于 $0$（由一致收敛性及", "$f$ 在 $x$ 处的连续性）。若仅逐点收敛，则有反例：", "$g_n(x) = nx\\,\\eu^{-nx^2} \\to 0$ 在 $\\intcc{0}{1}$ 上逐点收敛，", "且 $g_n$ 与极限函数均连续，但在 $x_n =", "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2n}} \\to 0$ 处：", "\\[", "g_n(x_n) = \\sqrt{\\frac n2}\\,\\eu^{-1/2} \\longrightarrow +\\infty", "\\neq 0 = f(0) .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:funcseq:12}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 归纳法。$n = 1$ 时即为定义。假设", "        对 $n$ 的公式成立，令 $g(x) = \\int_0^x \\frac{(x-t)^n}{n!}", "        f(t)\\dd t$。被积函数在 $(x,t)$ 上连续，", "        且为 $C^1$（关于 $x$）时，变上限含参积分", "        的求导公式如下：", "        \\[", "        g'(x) = \\frac{(x-x)^n}{n!}f(x)", "        + \\int_0^x \\frac{(x-t)^{n-1}}{(n-1)!}f(t)\\dd t", "        = T^nf(x)", "        \\]", "        （将 $g(x+h) - g(x)$ 拆为", "        窄条积分 $\\int_x^{x+h}$，它为 $O(h\\cdot\\sup)$，被积函数在", "        $t = x$ 处按 $h^n$ 的量级消失，另一部分为固定", "        积分对 $x$ 的增量部分，借助中值不等式", "        及连续性估计）。另外 $(T^{n+1}f)' = T^nf$", "        （微积分基本定理），且 $g(0) =", "        T^{n+1}f(0) = 0$：$T^nf$ 的两个原函数，", "        在 $0$ 处为零者必相同，故 $T^{n+1}f = g$。其估计为：", "        \\[", "        \\abs{T^nf(x)} \\leq \\norm f_\\infty", "        \\int_0^x \\frac{(x-t)^{n-1}}{(n-1)!}\\dd t", "        = \\norm f_\\infty\\,\\frac{x^n}{n!}", "        \\leq \\frac{\\norm f_\\infty}{n!} .", "        \\]", "  \\item $\\sum_n \\norm{T^nf}_\\infty \\leq \\eu\\,\\norm f_\\infty$：", "        正规收敛，从而一致收敛；$S$ 连续。", "        部分和满足 $S_N = f + T S_{N-1}$，且 $T$", "        是 $1$-利普希茨的（范数为 $\\norm\\cdot_\\infty$）", "        （$\\abs{Tg(x)} \\leq x\\norm g_\\infty$）：令 $N \\to", "        \\infty$ 于两端，得 $S = f + TS$。", "  \\item 令 $V(x) = f(x) + \\eu^x\\int_0^x \\eu^{-t}f(t)\\dd t$。", "        于是 $V - f$ 为 $C^1$，且 $(V-f)'(x) =", "        \\eu^x\\int_0^x\\eu^{-t}f + f(x) = V(x)$，又 $(TV)' = V$", "        且 $(V - f)(0) = TV(0) = 0$：故 $V - f = TV$，即", "        $V$ 满足该方程。唯一性：若 $S_1, S_2$ 为", "        连续解，$D = S_1 - S_2$ 满足 $D =", "        TD$，故 $D = T^nD$ 对一切 $n$ 成立，且 $\\norm D_\\infty", "        \\leq \\frac{\\norm D_\\infty}{n!} \\to 0$：$D = 0$。", "        因此", "        \\[", "        \\sum_{n\\geq0} T^nf(x) = f(x) +", "        \\int_0^x \\eu^{x-t}f(t)\\,\\dd t .", "        \\]", "        （级数 $\\sum T^n$ 是算子的几何级数，", "        初步体现了预解式", "        $(\\mathrm{Id} - T)^{-1}$ 的思想，将在本科三年级", "        分册中展开）。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", ""]}